  "body": "Connect the reviewed bounded PSSM/Chase observer to a separate sealed C\u2192ABBA producer. Common clock and Texture observations stay ON across all processes; only callback state profiling follows canaryON then OFF0/ON0/ON1/OFF1. Exact call/camera association, normal task.cont, finite copied pose/two-split MVP and named getter counts are required; complete raw\u2192canvas\u2192derivedI420 replay remains mandatory.\n\nPreserves all261frozen predecessor files and both reviewed observer modules;280source pins. Explicit six-file/workflow fork retains source CI, one-use FD, image006/host identity, lease, stopped-container copies, visibility, member/storage, OOM and cleanup gates. NewIDrenderer-tasks-20261114-01; new request-only C child and distinct Acontrol child, no oldrequest retry. C1824+A3936=5760namedgetter budget;5providers/30pairs total, no model/ORT/GPU extras. Actual native activation only after this exact-source CI; A requires actual closed C, successful upload, terminal separate attestor and genuine root/fresh raw acceptance while host remains held.\n\nValidation:15focusedPASS5.210s; full1252tests0failures/7existing skips/112.724s. Fresh gpt-6-astra/medium whole-source review of62dc0ab2230339eb0cae9519ba3bb7ab59722e2d: C0/I0/M0; independently15testsPASS5.264s,280sourcepins,261unchanged and stdlib-only successful ONmetadata validation verified. No correction pass/rereview. Review declines actual runtime/overhead/outcome and sourceCI/artifact provenance until measured; no neutrality/GPU cause/modelquality/Stage7 success. Root owns those later actual checks. Fork maintenance cost, common observers' overhead and existing-checkout isolation limit are recorded in ledger.\n\nSource plan/spec: docs/superpowers/{plans,specs}/2026-11-14-renderer-tasks-sealed.md\nLedger: docs/STAGE7_RENDERER_TASKS_SEALED_LEDGER.md\nOriginal strict0/4FAIL/Stage7INCOMPLETE persist. No main merge or Cloud/registry publication. Generated SMALL ONNX CI is separate from official MD-V3 model.\n\n\nExact source qualification (source remains62dc0ab2230339eb0cae9519ba3bb7ab59722e2d):\n\n- push [43584473103](https://github.com/rownlvh8875-coder/big-model-closed-loop-benchmark/actions/runs/43584473103),attempt1SUCCESS; jobs onnx-interface-test:132415913307SUCCESS, synthetic-unit:132415913475SUCCESS; artifacts0.\n- pull_request [43584527532](https://github.com/rownlvh8875-coder/big-model-closed-loop-benchmark/actions/runs/43584527532),attempt1SUCCESS; jobs synthetic-unit:132416076292SUCCESS, onnx-interface-test:132416076584SUCCESS; artifacts0.\n\nNative activation is a separate request-only child. The source review/CI does not assert a native outcome. Actual acquisition/root/fresh gates and scientific limitations are recorded in the later result/evidence Draft. Main merge and Cloud/registry publication remain excluded.\n",
